# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

calls is project
calls purpose "Call operations with inputs and outputs, two of them recursive; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
calls target console
calls version "0.1.0"
calls language refined 1
calls standardLibrary 1
calls allows write console.stdout none
calls requires none
calls includesModule calls
calls entry calls.main
